title: The Congress of PPS
subtitle: An urgent card: the delegates gather, and the congress can adopt a resolution.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.congressAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.congress (Z — 1.07, the user's decisions of 7–8 XI 2026; P): an urgent card of the party when a characteristic of the
// party is ready, at most once a year. A resolution adopts a ready characteristic or leaves an adopted one and costs the action
// of the month; "No new resolutions" closes the congress for a year without cost. The congress is a device of the game: the dates
// and resolutions of the congresses of PPS 1922–1926 are TBD (HISTORICAL_SOURCES.md, PL-PROFILES-1.07).
PolishParty.congressView(Q);
!}

= The congress of PPS

Delegates from the whole country gather in Warsaw. The congress can adopt a resolution that will define for years what the party is. [? if pl_cg_intro : [+ pl_cg_intro +] ?]

- @adopt_unionism
- @adopt_worker_peasant
- @adopt_federalism
- @adopt_parliamentarism
- @adopt_strike_action
- @adopt_militarism
- @adopt_reformism
- @adopt_radicalism
- @drop_unionism
- @drop_worker_peasant
- @drop_federalism
- @drop_parliamentarism
- @drop_strike_action
- @drop_militarism
- @drop_reformism
- @drop_radicalism
- @none
- @later

@adopt_unionism
title: [+ pl_cg_unionism_title +]
subtitle: [+ pl_cg_unionism_text +]
view-if: pl_cg_unionism_ready = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.congressStatus(Q, 'adopt:unionism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_cg_unionism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_cg_result = PolishParty.congressChoose(Q, 'adopt:unionism');
!}
go-to: result

