@none
title: No new resolutions
subtitle: Costs no action. The congress ends, and the next one meets in a year at the earliest.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_cg_result = PolishParty.congressChoose(Q, 'none');
!}
go-to: result

@later
title: Not now
subtitle: The card stays in the hand until the congress is held.
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= The congress of PPS

